{"id": "70617", "title": "灰色黎明", "author": "天外飞星", "category": "都市言情", "count": 14, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70617.htm", "intro": "作者应该是受到当年多拉家常著名硬派（也叫无情派）大师的影响，全书集惊险、人性、情爱之大成。表象上看似家庭婚外情引发的惊涑，但实质上仍然是浪漫的、唯美的。尤其是最后，众人的归宿和故事的结尾，同样延续了开头的微妙氛围。我们通常在现实生活中没有的完美结局，在这里至少寻找到了一个貌似欢乐的所在——西藏高原那令人向往的、与世隔绝的人间天堂。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70617", "chapters": [{"title": "第01章", "file": "11049306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02章", "file": "11049428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03章", "file": "11049429.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第04章", "file": "11049430.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第05章", "file": "11049431.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第06章", "file": "11049432.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第07章", "file": "11049433.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第08章", "file": "11049434.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第09章", "file": "11049435.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "11049436.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "11049437.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "11049438.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "11049439.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "11049440.html", "available": true}]}